i di protezione individuale possono trasformarsi rapidamente in situazioni pericolose. Imparate a riconoscere tempestivamente i pericoli e ad agire in modo sicuro.", "short_description": "Scoprite la sicurezza sul lavoro nell'edilizia in legno in modo virtuale e realistico: riconoscere i rischi tipici, reagire correttamente, senza alcun pericolo di lesioni. Imparate a evitare errori e a utilizzare in modo sicuro utensili e moduli."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "WoodConstructionCover - Querformat.png", "id": "1735425970481901", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821696_1735425973815234_7026648888461368653_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tlJ75V8j46EQ7kNvwGsM_QG&_nc_oc=AdpMJC3LwX9CmjGOG8pjfumFw2hM0nHScHLfNRlQy9C8kaDoQwvFYymS-0IolQdAvmk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTZKTJxNt81r1L2W-CEJrpBa3E9qgXjPHmeGJVTsdlUMA&oe=6AE73A23"}, {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1404469407857988", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819845_1404469411191321_2374008257608234867_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=U3_cZjAzQV4Q7kNvwEaKcR4&_nc_oc=AdrnR2cbwurYG7h2vR7M1foPYP0JjkhCngZoHUTFHE6Jn7GxZw1lTqw3UPGNllXThZk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQS3l24fcMVOW1arGp1ODqquElcTIWnUA0FgrYeevK8_rg&oe=6AE75E5D"}, {"file_name": "WoodConstructionCover - Hochformat.png", "id": "1138371601691473", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491822307_1138371605024806_6545105809583793091_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wdaeaP1ZGxkQ7kNvwGwIqex&_nc_oc=AdqEU_76c5jWvV1c3AvHELatZJz68J5JJ8068YfBW5NSUszQs88JDHURLLDYQb68Qkg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTJc624LZ16aB_a-76_QjxjwK0RR2cnwvo7KYkmNbXLaQ&oe=6AE74CCA"}, {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1061729109131103", "im